\frac{1}{u} + \frac{\mu}{v} = \frac{\mu - 1}{r}
\end{equation}

বা, $\frac{1}{20\, \text{cm}} + \frac{1.5}{v} = \frac{1.5 - 1}{-10\, \text{cm}}$

