\begin{equation}
\frac{1}{u} + \frac{1}{v} = \frac{1}{f}
\end{equation}

বা, \(\frac{1}{v} = \frac{1}{f} - \frac{1}{u}\)

বা, \(\frac{1}{v} = \frac{1}{16 \text{ cm}} - \frac{1}{12 \text{ cm}} = -\frac{1}{48 \text{ cm}}\)

\(\therefore v = -48 \text{ cm}\)

